name lp
# F1 (not lent: it returns r3) steps r8 by 4 and back inside a counted loop (`add #4,r8 ; mov.l @r8,r2 ; add #-4,r8 ; dt r1 ; bf`): keeps r8 on every path (A3-201's step-back, in a loop). Right: no caution
ret 1,0
