name sp
# the model keeps r15 across an unlent call too: F1 (not lent: it reads r3) pops a word (`add #4,r15`) when r3 != 0; the caller (frame in r14) reads its local at @r15 after the call: runs with r3 != 0 read the word above (9). Right: a caution at the call
