name sw1
# A3-108's wording: F0 pushes r8 and PR and calls U2, which writes its incoming stack word (`mov.l @r15,r1 ; mov.l r1,@r15`: the word at the call's r15, F0's saved PR); F0 pops PR and r8 after: "a saved register's word ..." (control)
