name sa2
# 06060F34/008's shape: &local (r14 + 8) kept in the frame word r14 + 16; U1 lent (`mov #1,r1 ; rts ; mov.b r1,@r5`: stores through r5) handed r14 + 9 in r5, then U2 (not lent: it returns r3) handed the word in r5 (`mov.l @(16,r14),r5`): the address the word holds is the argument the text shows (pxStack_8)
